1
00:00:00,407 --> 00:00:01,480
Two thousand years ago,

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,811
a Chinese court tried to
count something strange —

3
00:00:03,811 --> 00:00:05,723
the hour at which its
empire fell asleep.

4
00:00:05,723 --> 00:00:07,075
Runners went out at
midnight,

5
00:00:07,075 --> 00:00:08,054
tallying lit windows.

6
00:00:08,054 --> 00:00:09,593
The answer was already in
a book.

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,261
The book names the hour,

8
00:00:11,261 --> 00:00:12,810
and the name it gives is
beautiful.

9
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:14,447
It calls it the joining of the
dark —

10
00:00:14,447 --> 00:00:16,217
the moment when the ten
thousand people,

11
00:00:16,217 --> 00:00:17,942
all of them at once, lie
down together,

12
00:00:17,942 --> 00:00:19,800
on the same reckoning as
heaven and earth.

13
00:00:20,449 --> 00:00:22,393
Then the count is a
formality, physician.

14
00:00:22,393 --> 00:00:23,530
Send the runners anyway.

15
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:25,237
I want the tally in my hand
by dawn.

16
00:00:25,237 --> 00:00:26,138
And while we wait —

17
00:00:26,138 --> 00:00:28,366
a question of natural
philosophy, nothing more.

18
00:00:28,366 --> 00:00:29,551
Why do the old not sleep?

19
00:00:30,119 --> 00:00:31,754
In the vigorous the roads
run clear,

20
00:00:31,754 --> 00:00:33,615
and the two currents keep
their schedule.

21
00:00:33,615 --> 00:00:35,976
In the old the roads run
rough. The nutritive thins,

22
00:00:35,976 --> 00:00:37,838
and the guard turns and
campaigns inward.

23
00:00:37,838 --> 00:00:39,881
That is the text's answer,
not a physician's.

24
00:00:40,014 --> 00:00:42,346
The young get both halves
— keen by day,

25
00:00:42,346 --> 00:00:45,262
asleep by night. The old
lose both. In this model,

26
00:00:45,262 --> 00:00:48,062
ageing does not move your
sleep to another hour.

27
00:00:48,062 --> 00:00:49,986
It takes one end, then the
other.

28
00:00:50,096 --> 00:00:51,787
The runners came back at
dawn,

29
00:00:51,787 --> 00:00:54,380
and the number was wrong
by exactly one house,

30
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:56,465
and everyone at court
knew which one.

31
00:00:56,465 --> 00:00:59,002
The Emperor's Inner
Canon. Ling Shu eighteen.

32
00:00:59,002 --> 00:00:59,904
The Night Watch.

33
00:01:00,354 --> 00:01:02,794
A dramatized adaptation of
a classical philosophical

34
00:01:02,794 --> 00:01:03,968
text. Not medical advice.

35
00:01:03,968 --> 00:01:06,455
We present the Inner Canon
as history and philosophy,

36
00:01:06,455 --> 00:01:08,660
and we say plainly where
its mechanism does not

37
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:09,646
survive the evidence.
